{"id":"a30e68579dff7246","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map.md","title":"ZFC Fun Evaluation Map","display":"df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map — ZFC Fun Evaluation Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map","58-df-zfc-map-evaluation-map"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map — ZFC Fun Evaluation Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-map-evaluation-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-evaluation-map — ZFC Fun Evaluation Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,X,Y,F,A,B\\in V\">\\(e,X,Y,F,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunEvaluationMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunEvaluationMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapEvaluationMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapEvaluationMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunEvaluationMap}_S(e,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}(e,Y^X\\times X,Y)\\land \\forall f\\in Y^X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(e(\\langle f,x\\rangle)=f(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunEvaluationMap}_S(e,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Function}(e,Y^X\\times X,Y)\\land \\forall f\\in Y^X\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(e(\\langle f,x\\rangle)=f(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapEvaluationMap}_S(e,F,A,B)\\leftrightarrow F\\subseteq B^A\\land \\operatorname{Function}(e,F\\times A,B)\\land \\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(e(\\langle f,a\\rangle)=f(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}evaluation\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMapEvaluationMap}_S(e,F,A,B)\\leftrightarrow F\\subseteq B^A\\land \\operatorname{Function}(e,F\\times A,B)\\land \\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(e(\\langle f,a\\rangle)=f(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-map-evaluation-map</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\